<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan weekly forex reserves at $1.679 bln.</title>
<headline>Pakistan weekly forex reserves at $1.679 bln.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the weekly foreign exchange reserves holdings position in Pakistan:</p>
<p>(BLN DLRS)		March 1    Feb 20    FEB 29, 1996</p>
<p> TOTAL			1.679	1.530    2.048</p>
<p> Forex in Pakistan	0.521	0.566    1.048</p>
<p> Forex outside Pakistan 0.480	0.284    0.288</p>
<p> Gold coins and bullion 0.676	0.676    0.704</p>
<p> Special Drawing Rights 0.002	0.004    0.008</p>
<p>(The central bank has adopted Saturday instead of Thursday for calculating weekly figures after the government changed the weekend to Sunday from Friday) -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
